<div class="cart-drawer__checkout">
  <div class="cart-drawer__field">
    <label for="checkout-name" class="cart-drawer__label">Nombre y Apellido</label>
    <input
      id="checkout-name"
      class="cart-drawer__input"
      type="text"
      placeholder="Ej: Juan Pérez"
      autocomplete="name"
      required
      data-cart-role="checkout-name"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="cart-drawer__field">
    <span class="cart-drawer__label">Entrega</span>
    <div id="checkout-delivery" class="cart-drawer__options" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Método de entrega" data-cart-role="checkout-delivery">
      <label class="cart-drawer__option">
        <input type="radio" name="delivery" value="retiro" class="cart-drawer__option-input" checked />
        <span class="cart-drawer__option-label">Retiro en Local</span>
      </label>
      <label class="cart-drawer__option">
        <input type="radio" name="delivery" value="envio" class="cart-drawer__option-input" />
        <span class="cart-drawer__option-label">Envío por Cadete</span>
      </label>
    </div>

    <div id="checkout-address-wrapper" class="cart-drawer__field--address" data-cart-role="checkout-address-wrapper">
      <div class="cart-drawer__field">
        <label for="checkout-address" class="cart-drawer__label">Dirección de Entrega</label>
        <input
          id="checkout-address"
          class="cart-drawer__input"
          type="text"
          placeholder="Ej: Av. Italia 1234, Dpto 2B"
          autocomplete="street-address"
          data-cart-role="checkout-address"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="checkout-delivery-info" class="cart-drawer__info" data-cart-role="checkout-delivery-info" hidden>
      💡 El costo del envío se coordina con el cadete vía WhatsApp.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cart-drawer__field">
    <span class="cart-drawer__label">Pago</span>
    <div id="checkout-payment" class="cart-drawer__options" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Método de pago" data-cart-role="checkout-payment">
      <label class="cart-drawer__option">
        <input type="radio" name="payment" value="efectivo" class="cart-drawer__option-input" checked />
        <span class="cart-drawer__option-label">Efectivo</span>
      </label>
      <label class="cart-drawer__option">
        <input type="radio" name="payment" value="transferencia" class="cart-drawer__option-input" />
        <span class="cart-drawer__option-label">Transferencia</span>
      </label>
    </div>
    <div id="checkout-payment-info" class="cart-drawer__info" data-cart-role="checkout-payment-info" hidden>
      📋 Recordá enviar el comprobante de transferencia por WhatsApp para procesar tu pedido.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cart-drawer__info cart-drawer__info--disclaimer" id="cart-disclaimer" data-cart-role="disclaimer" hidden>
    ⚖️ El precio final se calcula con el peso exacto en la balanza al preparar tu pedido. El monto final puede variar unos gramos a favor o en contra.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .cart-drawer__checkout {
    flex: 1;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .cart-drawer__field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .cart-drawer__label {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .cart-drawer__input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: none;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-normal);
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
  }

  .cart-drawer__input::placeholder {
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .cart-drawer__input:focus {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .cart-drawer__input.field--error {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-error);
  }

  .cart-drawer__options {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .cart-drawer__option {
    flex: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .cart-drawer__option-input {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
  }

  .cart-drawer__option-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast), background-color var(--transition-fast);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cart-drawer__option-input:checked + .cart-drawer__option-label {
    color: var(--color-brand);
    border-color: var(--color-brand);
    background-color: rgba(var(--color-brand-rgb), 0.08);
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .cart-drawer__option-label:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .cart-drawer__option-input:checked + .cart-drawer__option-label:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-brand);
      color: var(--color-brand);
    }
  }

  .cart-drawer__field--address {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 0fr;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: grid-template-rows 0.35s ease, opacity 0.25s ease;
  }

  .cart-drawer__field--address.visible {
    grid-template-rows: 1fr;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .cart-drawer__field--address > div {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cart-drawer__info {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-hover);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .cart-drawer__info[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
</style>
